```mermaid
graph TD
    User((User)) --> IGW[Internet Gateway]
    IGW --> ALB[Application Load Balancer]
    ALB --> ASG_Web[Web Auto Scaling Group\nPrivate Subnet]
    ASG_Web --> ASG_App[App Auto Scaling Group\nPrivate Subnet]
    ASG_App --> RDS[(RDS Database\nData Subnet)]
    
    subgraph VPC [VPC 10.0.0.0/16]
        subgraph Public_AZ1 [Public Subnet AZ-A]
            IGW
            ALB
        end
        subgraph Private_AZ1 [Private Subnet AZ-A]
            ASG_Web
            ASG_App
        end
        subgraph Data_AZ1 [Data Subnet AZ-A]
            RDS
        end
    end
```
